Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi kids, I'm Qiqi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to Qiqi Meets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the Little Prince~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.43,0:00:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi tried on the vain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,man's big hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But the mirror only showed herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Praising yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.19,0:00:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,is no fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.39,0:00:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,they arrive at a gray planet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,with lots of empty bottl
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.73,0:00:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,es!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The little prince and Qiqi kept
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.51,0:00:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,flying,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,still on their way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.99,0:00:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This time they came to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,a gray planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.99,0:00:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A man sat on the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,with many many empty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,bottles beside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.59,0:00:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He was drinking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.54,0:00:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,from a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.46,0:00:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.19,0:00:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi asked curiously.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm drinking wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.35,0:01:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The man said with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.57,0:01:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,his head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you drink wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.55,0:01:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,To forget something I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,embarrassed about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.62,0:01:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.31,0:01:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Drinking makes me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.33,0:01:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.35,0:01:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The man whispered.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi tilted her head
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.07,0:01:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you drink to forget
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,that you drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.31,0:01:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.91,0:01:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,drinking right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.11,0:01:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The man took another sip
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and said nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.35,0:01:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems to be going in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.35,0:01:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,circles and can't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.65,0:01:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi whispered to the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,little prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.47,0:01:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When you don't look at a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.73,0:01:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.17,0:01:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,it only gets bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.55,0:01:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi looked at the empty bottles
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.53,0:01:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,— more and more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If he stopped and looked at what he's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:01:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,afraid of,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:02:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,would he not need
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,facing a problem is braver
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.65,0:02:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,than running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.11,0:02:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time I'm scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look at it first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi held the little prince's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.80,0:02:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They gently flew away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The man's bottles kept
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,growing and growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.47,0:02:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,have you ever been
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.98,0:02:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,scared of something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Try looking at it first — maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.82,0:02:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not as scary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,as you think~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi and the little prince are going to a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,planet that keeps turning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,lights on and off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,see you tomorrow~ ⭐
